{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"07c9872820055287616c06096e099e9b6d73427896d2fde90ddea873a27a398d","ja":"三浦さん、お疲れさまです。朝からずっと、レッスン\nされていたのですか？　素晴らしい集中力ですね。","zh":"三浦小姐，辛苦了。您从早上开始就一直\n在练习吗？专注力真厉害呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"982602264fcc143bdecbbb1220a2afd6094d7df65ae7b66cf334790fc868c1d6","ja":"あずさ、がんばっててかっこいいぞ～！","zh":"梓这么努力，好帅气呀～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2fe3570dbce8a3214e6dd9f40e0cc7d8dcc321250f45c90133dabb0686a1d7eb","ja":"あっ……ち、ちがうのよ、ふたりとも。\n私はただ……。はぁ……。","zh":"啊……不、不是那样的，你们两个。\n我只是……唉……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3fdb2ddeb05706cbec4acb9c15e4e6e311b12c974614311d767a1cbb7803e6ff","ja":"あずさ、なやみがあるの……？\nたまきたちに教えて！","zh":"梓，你有什么烦恼吗……？\n跟环我们说说嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5e7bf8e5f4290f58832538b158431a69a8f6bc2bea8395a245efd1a884cf3eb8","ja":"そうですね。甘いものでも食べながら、\nお話ししていただけませんか？","zh":"说得也是呢。能不能一边吃点甜食，\n一边和我聊聊呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3a1d89c8798b2b6d0d8e2c3ee9006afe9e7719074f08f4371a8cf8fa3e6bfed3","ja":"美味しいあんみつを\n買ってきましたので。","zh":"因为我买了\n美味的馅蜜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2476909ab41c6f4b2fb44bbf05bbebcb4a3888ec3266c6cdec6f468b23098864","ja":"まあっ……！\n紬ちゃんのお見立てなら間違いないわねっ♪","zh":"哎呀……！\n既然是小紬挑选的，那就肯定没错啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1047.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"920424349913775a728520ce16f4fb44c24efea04751eafd8f8e37e3fc6d343f","ja":"あとね、おやぶんがチーズケーキを\n持ってきてくれたんだ！　人気のお店のだって！","zh":"还有哦，老大带来了芝士蛋糕！\n听说是人气名店的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
